<title>UK: World Bank sets NZ$100 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets NZ$100 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     8.0	 MATURITY    23.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.50     PAY DATE    23.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER GLOBAL MULTI-CURRENCY NOTE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
